  <text x="714" y="138" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Geist, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#E4F3F0">and cite</text>

  <text x="390" y="202" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Geist, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#5F6C6E">The media file is the asset. The surrounding text is the retrievable evidence.</text>
